:30 ; 46:2 , 13 , 26 ; 49:30 ; 50:17 ; 51:34 ; 52:4 , 12 ; Ezek 26:7 ; 29:18 ; 29:19 ; Ezekiel 29:30; so Qr Jer 49:28 (Kt מ ׳נבוכדראצור ׳ב ); נְבוּבַדְרֶאצַּר֑ ( בָּבֶל מֶלֶךְ omitted) 32:1 ; 52:28-29 , 30 . Spelt corruptly with n , מ ׳נְבוּכַדְנֶאצַּר ׳ב (compare Schr COT 2Kin 24:1 n .) 2Chr 36:6 ; Dan 1:1 ; Jer 27:6 , 8 , 20 ; 28:3 ; 29:3 ; Ezra 2:1 Qr (Kt מ ׳נבוכדבצור ׳ב , compare Jer 49:8 above); נְבוּכַדְנֶאצַּר alone 2Chr 36:7 , 10 , 13 ( נ ׳הַמֶּלֶךְ ), Jer 29:1 ; ׳מ ׳ב נְבֻכַדְנֶאצַּר 2Kin 24:1 , 10 , 11 ; 25:1 , 8 , 22 ; Jer 28:11 , 14 ; נְבֻכַדְנֶאצַּר֑ 1 Chronicles 5:41; מ ׳נְבוּכַדְנֶצַּר ׳ב Neh 7:6 ; Est 2:6 ; נְבוּכַדְנֶצַּר Ezra 1:7 ( ׳מ ׳ב omitted), נְבֻכַדְנֶצַּר Dan 2:1 (twice in verse), נְבֻכַדְנֶצַּ֑ר 1:18 (see also Tobit 14:5, Judg 1:1 +? ᵐ5 above) — On Nebuchadnezzar see further Tiele Babylonian-Assyrian Gesch., 421 ff., 454 ff. נְבוּכַדְנֶצַּר 31 proper name, masculine (= Biblical Hebrew רֶאצַּר -, etc.); — Dan 2:28 23 t. Daniel; Ezra 5:12 , 14 ; 6:5 ; ׳נְבֻכ Dan 3:3 3 t. Daniel.","rootNote":"or נְבֻּכַדְנֶאצַּר ; (2 Kings 24:1,10), or נְבוּכַדְנֶצַּר ; (Esther 2:6; Daniel 1:18), or נְבוּכַדְרֶאצַּר ; or נְבוּכַדְרֶאצּוֹר ; (Ezra 2:1; Jeremiah 49:28), or foreign derivation;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 5 41","keyReferences":["1Chr 5 41","2Chr 36 6","2Chr 36 7","2Chr 36 10","2Chr 36 13","2Kgs 24 1","2Kgs 24 10","2Kgs 24 11"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":60,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 5 41","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":41,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נְבֻכַדְנֶאצַּֽר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"2Chr 36 6","book":"2Chr","chapter":36,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נְבוּכַדְנֶאצַּ֖ר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"2Chr 36 7","book":"2Chr","chapter":36,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נְבוּכַדְנֶאצַּ֖ר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"2Chr 36 